<script type="application/json" data-nuxt-data="nuxt-app" data-ssr="true" id="__NUXT_DATA__" data-src="/_payload.json?42c34f81-3e8f-40ce-8c0e-09a4890a31bd">[{"state":1,"once":15,"_errors":16,"serverRendered":18,"path":19,"pinia":20,"prerenderedAt":174},["Reactive",2],{"$ssanity-preview-environment":3,"$spageTransition":4,"$scompanyNavPrev":6,"$scompanyNavNext":6,"$scompanyNavVisible":7,"$ssite-config":8},"checking",{"delay":5,"promise":6},0,null,false,{"_priority":9,"env":12,"name":13,"trailingSlash":7,"url":14},{"name":10,"env":11,"url":10,"trailingSlash":10},-3,-15,"production","Hashgraph Ventures","https:\u002F\u002Fhashgraphvc.com\u002F",["Set"],["ShallowReactive",17],{"sanity-NLPorUXA_a-no2_3oyVevAMBp-XZ-77-RLI1qKv0B7Y":-1,"sanity-xKo1nDeKQAfyCpItbhQTucHEncKIMFCGyrwuHHqGKs0":-1},true,"\u002F",["Reactive",21],{"app":22,"data":24},{"windowSize":23,"isSoundMuted":18,"isLoaderVisible":18,"isTouch":7,"isWebGPUSupported":18,"isWebGPUBrowserSupported":18},{"width":5,"height":5},{"globalData":25,"allCompanies":60,"allTeamMembers":131,"teamActiveIndex":5},{"socials":26,"footerTitle":38,"footerCopyrights":50,"legalNav":51,"seo":56},[27,31,35],{"label":28,"type":29,"url":30},"Email","email","mailto:info@hashgraphvc.com",{"label":32,"type":33,"url":34},"X (Twitter)","external","https:\u002F\u002Fx.com\u002FHashgraphVC",{"label":36,"type":33,"url":37},"LinkedIn","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.linkedin.com\u002Fcompany\u002Fhashgraph-ventures\u002F",[39],{"_key":40,"_type":41,"children":42,"markDefs":48,"style":49},"0fbb6cf1908e","block",[43],{"_key":44,"_type":45,"marks":46,"text":47},"792278ef20c5","span",[],"We prioritize warm introductions\nand ecosystem referrals",[],"normal","© Hashgraph Ventures {year}",[52],{"label":53,"type":54,"url":55},"Privacy Policy","internal","\u002Fprivacy-policy",{"title":57,"description":58,"image":59},"Hashgraph Ventures | AI & Blockchain Venture Capital","Venture capital firm investing in AI & blockchain startups from pre-seed to Series A, supporting founders with capital, expertise, and global reach.","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Fimages\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002F57642f3160650fff13a36c9b7546631533865dc2-1200x630.png",[61,79,97,113],{"slug":62,"url":63,"logo":64,"name":65,"copy":66,"founded":6,"invested":6,"stage":6,"websiteUrl":75,"seo":76},"debyt","\u002Fcompanies\u002Fdebyt","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Ffiles\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002F8f409b899eda0a6598e1f59042a10bb28ffc3a6f.svg","Debyt",[67],{"_key":68,"_type":41,"children":69,"markDefs":74,"style":49},"3fb6b3531126",[70],{"_key":71,"_type":45,"marks":72,"text":73},"5587e852bed4",[],"Debyt is building the infrastructure for the next generation of debit card accounts, unlocking stablecoin-powered banking globally. They are developing the stablecoin orchestration layer and card-issuing rails required for broad consumer adoption by retrofitting stablecoins directly into today’s card processors, sponsor banks and large-scale card issuing programs.",[],"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.debyt.xyz\u002F",{"title":77,"description":78,"image":59},"Debyt | Stablecoin Card Infrastructure | Hashgraph Ventures","Debyt builds stablecoin-powered debit card infrastructure, enabling global banking through modern card issuing rails and payment systems.",{"slug":80,"url":81,"logo":82,"name":83,"copy":84,"founded":6,"invested":6,"stage":6,"websiteUrl":93,"seo":94},"rava","\u002Fcompanies\u002Frava","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Ffiles\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002Fbbe762805f8a8f30923897ce054a1805b19f72ae.svg","Rava",[85],{"_key":86,"_type":41,"children":87,"markDefs":92,"style":49},"bc95ba0caa49",[88],{"_key":89,"_type":45,"marks":90,"text":91},"f6b0c489e0e3",[],"Rava aims to be the clearing house and settlement engine for tokenized assets and RWAs by solving a critical market gap: the $30B+ in tokenized assets that sit idle due to a lack of guaranteed pricing and settlement infrastructure. Rava offers a transparent, VaR-informed settlement engine with open pricing and liquidation values fully verifiable on-chain.",[],"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.rava.money",{"title":95,"description":96,"image":6},"Rava | Tokenized Asset Settlement | Hashgraph Ventures","Rava builds a settlement engine for tokenized assets and RWAs, enabling transparent pricing and on-chain liquidation for scalable market infrastructure.",{"slug":98,"url":99,"logo":100,"name":98,"copy":101,"founded":6,"invested":6,"stage":6,"websiteUrl":6,"seo":110},"100s","\u002Fcompanies\u002F100s","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Ffiles\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002F4bfda0b43330ee9caf21baa5dbb67c0a2116a383.svg",[102],{"_key":103,"_type":41,"children":104,"markDefs":109,"style":49},"18dc4735fa97",[105],{"_key":106,"_type":45,"marks":107,"text":108},"de6f3988ebc1",[],"100s is the world's first unified exchange, clearinghouse and data standard for real-time event risk – supporting markets including financial derivatives, sports betting and any event market traditionally served by prediction markets. 100s combines institutional-grade derivatives technology with blockchain settlement to create transparent, competitive markets where users trade against each other, not against the house.",[],{"title":111,"description":112,"image":59},"100s | Event Risk Exchange | Hashgraph Ventures","100s is a real-time event risk exchange and clearinghouse, enabling transparent markets for derivatives, sports betting and prediction markets.",{"slug":114,"url":115,"logo":116,"name":117,"copy":118,"founded":6,"invested":6,"stage":6,"websiteUrl":127,"seo":128},"bloxtel","\u002Fcompanies\u002Fbloxtel","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Ffiles\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002F8cabc54021e8a76831d69a208c8b50042ba3b37c.svg","Bloxtel",[119],{"_key":120,"_type":41,"children":121,"markDefs":126,"style":49},"74e8db737c89",[122],{"_key":123,"_type":45,"marks":124,"text":125},"7526ca2acbb5",[],"Developer of a decentralized and autonomous 5G network platform, offering a turnkey private 5G solution for enterprise use cases with improved security and latency. Partnered with a major 5G access point OEM with early pilot programs with a major warehouse network operator and large retailers. Founded by the inventors of the eSIM.",[],"https:\u002F\u002Fbloxtel.com\u002F",{"title":129,"description":130,"image":59},"Bloxtel | Decentralized 5G Network | Hashgraph Ventures","Bloxtel builds decentralized 5G infrastructure, enabling secure, low-latency private networks for enterprise use cases.",[132,138,144,150,156,162,168],{"name":133,"position":134,"portrait":135,"depthMap":136,"normalMap":137},"Dara Campbell","Managing Partner","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Fimages\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002F3e89d5b6a2861a68c8d521c7fed603edc5f95e2f-1024x1024.webp","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Fimages\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002F9a10c8de53e038349a3b8d27f81d580590adcf28-1024x1024.webp","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Fimages\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002F72d67cec28cba9214e0ca7978bf50bafd4e41966-1024x1024.webp",{"name":139,"position":140,"portrait":141,"depthMap":142,"normalMap":143},"Will Patterson","Head of Venture","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Fimages\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002Fcc371fd0af9ea5a29fb51edeffd8c5c3171c5bfe-1024x1024.webp","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Fimages\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002Fb67ab460249ef0f17a231d4c339fb1fd08bc9922-1024x1024.webp","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Fimages\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002Fd96533ae3f2e0ac61cd49878394d8246a1037494-1024x1024.webp",{"name":145,"position":146,"portrait":147,"depthMap":148,"normalMap":149},"Arjun Chirumamilla","Senior Associate","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Fimages\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002F0c45708c13882c70d6b538f8e48ab8d65c640df2-1024x1024.webp","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sanity.io\u002Fimages\u002Fdiak0tmr\u002Fproduction\u002F36db9bbcbb12f5894ca01b48f7dd99e37583d6c7-1024x1024.webp","https:\u002F\u002Fcdn.sa